%%{init: {"sequence": {"wrapPadding": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Administrator<br/>(page /exec-envs)
  participant API as POST<br/>/api/admin/exec-envs/register
  participant REG as registry / lifecycle<br/>(bgp-execution-envs)
  participant BRK as broker Lambda
  participant CB as CodeBuild<br/>(target region)
  participant RP as redeploy-platform.sh
  U->>API: New wizard: pick region, jurisdiction, CIDR<br/>(candidates from account facts, SCP-blocked regions disabled)
  API->>REG: write descriptor, phase = registered
  API->>BRK: invokeDeployBroker(targetId, operationId)
  BRK->>BRK: check three allow-lists<br/>(target / operation / stack-name prefix)<br/>
  BRK->>CB: StartBuild(bgp-exec-env-deploy)
  CB->>CB: pre_build: AZ probe · bootstrap<br/>read source package<br/>(CDK assets of the control-plane deployment)<br/>
  CB->>CB: build: cdk deploy "BgpExecEnv-<slug>-*"<br/>
  CB->>CB: post_build: write back stack outputs<br/>
  API->>CB: readBuildStatus polling (page "Deployment progress")
  U->>API: "Check initialization" ⇒ probe-runner probes each component
  API->>REG: phase = initializing → active (ready)
  U->>RP: redeploy the control plane once to authorize the new region<br/>(EXECUTION_REGIONS / aws:RequestedRegion)
  U->>API: "Enable" ⇒ start accepting work
